# Read by the docs `build` script (node --env-file). Docusaurus' swc HTML minifier rewrites the inline outputs: it
# drops optional end tags, reorders CSS declarations and merges <style> elements, so check-build could not compare
# them with the gate's markup. It saved 1.6% of the HTML over brotli. With it off everywhere, a Windows build (where
# the minifier's native addon fails to load) produces the same HTML as CI and Vercel.
SKIP_HTML_MINIFICATION=true
